WEBVTT

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:03.859
Let's install naimix.

00:00:03.859 --> 00:00:11.193
You need Node 24 or newer, npm and git.

00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:14.157
Install the dependencies.

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:25.308
Copy the example settings, then compile.

00:00:25.308 --> 00:00:27.871
Check what you got.

00:00:27.876 --> 00:00:41.077
Two small settings files and a compiled server.
